   "en": "I've collected *50%.*",
   "zh": "\u6211\u5df2\u7ecf\u6536\u4e86 50%\u3002",
   "s": 1.5,
   "e": 3.06
  },
  {
   "seg": "b1a",
   "en": "Hi, I'm Rebecca,",
   "zh": "\u55e8,\u6211\u662f Rebecca,",
   "s": 3.267,
   "e": 3.847
  },
  {
   "seg": "b1a",
   "en": "and after joining the *one-day class,*",
   "zh": "\u4e0a\u5b8c\u4e00\u5929\u8bfe\u7a0b\u4e4b\u540e,",
   "s": 3.847,
   "e": 8.533
  },
  {
   "seg": "b1b",
   "en": "I started to explore *AI.*",
   "zh": "\u6211\u5f00\u59cb\u63a2\u7d22 AI\u3002",
   "s": 8.533,
   "e": 12.6
  },
  {
   "seg": "b2",
   "en": "Then one opportunity came,",
   "zh": "\u7136\u540e\u4e00\u4e2a\u673a\u4f1a\u6765\u4e86,",
   "s": 12.6,
   "e": 16.0
  },
  {
   "seg": "b2",
   "en": "somebody was looking for",
   "zh": "\u6709\u4eba\u5728\u627e",
   "s": 16.0,
   "e": 17.9
  },
  {
   "seg": "b2",
   "en": "somebody to make a *dashboard*",
   "zh": "\u4f1a\u505a\u4eea\u8868\u677f\u7684\u4eba",
   "s": 17.9,
   "e": 19.1
  },
  {
   "seg": "b2",
   "en": "in a niche I wasn't even familiar with.",
   "zh": "\u800c\u4e14\u662f\u6211\u5b8c\u5168\u4e0d\u719f\u6089\u7684\u9886\u57df\u3002",
   "s": 19.1,
   "e": 22.433
  },
  {
   "seg": "b3a",
   "en": "What was the niche?",
   "zh": "\u662f\u4ec0\u4e48\u9886\u57df?",
   "s": 22.433,
   "e": 23.62
  },
  {
   "seg": "b3b",
   "en": "*Trading.*",
   "zh": "\u4ea4\u6613\u3002",
   "s": 23.62,
   "e": 24.5
  },
  {
   "seg": "b3c",
   "en": "Yes, *US stocks.*",
   "zh": "\u5bf9,\u7f8e\u80a1\u3002",
   "s": 24.5,
   "e": 25.8
  },
  {
   "seg": "b4a",
   "en": "After *prompting* and learning more,",
   "zh": "\u7ecf\u8fc7\u4e0d\u65ad\u63d0\u793a\u548c\u5b66\u4e60,",
   "s": 25.8,
   "e": 29.333
  },
  {
   "seg": "b4b",
   "en": "I managed to *close*",
   "zh": "\u6211\u6210\u529f\u62ff\u4e0b\u4e86",
   "s": 29.333,
   "e": 30.413
  },
  {
