   "en": "the deal with the client.",
   "zh": "\u8fd9\u4e2a\u5ba2\u6237\u3002",
   "s": 30.413,
   "e": 33.2
  },
  {
   "seg": "b5a",
   "en": "So basically, you learn *Claude,*",
   "zh": "\u6240\u4ee5\u4f60\u5b66\u4e86 Claude,",
   "s": 33.2,
   "e": 34.84
  },
  {
